# Cloudflare Pages — normalize trailing slashes
# Without this, /about returns 404. With it, /about → /about/ → serves /about/index.html

/about                  /about/                  301
/contact                /contact/                301
/pricing                /pricing/                301
/faq                    /faq/                    301
/privacy-policy         /privacy-policy/         301
/terms-and-conditions   /terms-and-conditions/   301
/refund-policy          /refund-policy/          301
/cancellation-policy    /cancellation-policy/    301
